        "This review leaves out important context. Before the appointment, this individual explained that she had already received opinions from multiple doctors but did not agree with those recommendations and was looking for another opinion. Because of that, our staff repeatedly asked her to send the existing X-rays ahead of time so the doctor could review the case before she made the trip and determine whether our office could appropriately help. Those X-rays were never sent.\n\nShe then arrived already upset and became extremely rude and disruptive toward our staff, including yelling, cursing, and creating a scene. The doctor had not even examined her or evaluated the case at that point, so no treatment recommendation had been made by our office.\n\nWe absolutely welcome questions and second opinions, but we will not tolerate abusive or belligerent behavior toward our team. Because of the way the situation escalated, we declined service, and law enforcement ultimately had to be contacted to have her removed from the premises. We stand behind our decision to protect our staff and maintain a safe, professional environment for everyone in the office.",
